駅データ.jp terms of use (利用規約)
https://ekidata.jp/agreement.php
last revised 2025-06-04 (改定日：2025年6月4日), read on 2026-10-05

This is not an open licence. Everything under this directory comes from the
free data of 駅データ.jp (https://ekidata.jp/), provided by Value and Vision
Co., Ltd. (株式会社バリューアンドビジョン), and is subject to the site's terms.
The download needs a free member login; no credential is included here.

In short (the Japanese text of Articles 4 to 7 is quoted in README.md beside
this file): the data may be used for any purpose, commercial or not, without
contacting the company, except the uses Article 7 prohibits (Article 4).
Attribution is not required; credit or a link to the site is welcome. The
data may be modified (Article 5). Modified or unmodified, it may be provided
to third parties, but unmodified data only free of charge; this refers to the
data on its own, which may be built into a paid system (Article 6). The
company accepts no liability for damage from use, modification or provision.
Article 7 prohibits uses that encourage crime; obscene or otherwise offensive
uses; uses that may mislead consumers; infringing third parties' property,
privacy or reputation; defaming the company or its service or hindering its
business; and uses that may spread viruses or otherwise harm third parties.
The company may revise the terms on its site; use after a revision means
agreement to it.

The files under raw/<version>/ are the site's own CSVs, byte for byte
(unmodified data, provided here free of charge); MANIFEST.json records their
URLs, sizes, sha256 and row counts. Whoever passes them on must not charge
for them.

The Parquet under parquet/<version>/ is modified data, made from those CSVs:

  - columns were typed by name: the codes (company_cd, rr_cd, line_cd,
    station_cd, station_g_cd, pref_cd, station_cd1, station_cd2) and
    company_type, line_type, e_status, e_sort and zoom as integers, lon and
    lat as floats; every other column is the text of the CSV
  - empty fields became null
  - stations got a point geometry (WGS 84, OGC:CRS84) from lon and lat
  - no other value was changed, and rows keep the order of the CSV

The code that fetches, checks and converts is in the repository this dataset
was built from (https://github.com/yuiseki/ekidata-jp) and does not apply
here.
